    "name": "Kuta Paradiso Hotel",
    "detail": "I planned to return to my country in the morning, so I stayed one night near the airport. There is a shuttle bus to the airport, so I made a reservation during check-in. I stayed with three other people, and they upgraded us, so the room was spacious, which made me happy at the end of the trip. The hotel itself is a bit old, but it was properly cleaned, and the room had a sense of cleanliness. However, the room was close to the beach club, and there was loud music playing until late at night, making it difficult to sleep. However, the breakfast the next morning was substantial, and at this price, there were no issues. Overall, it was a satisfying stay. The supermarket in front of the hotel is about the size of a mini supermarket, so if you're planning to buy a lot of souvenirs, it's better to go to a larger supermarket.",
